  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "產業碳足跡盤查與減碳實務",
    "sub_ename": "PRACTICE FOR INDUSTRIAL CARBON FOOTPRINT INVENTORY AND CARBON REDUCTION STRATEGY",
    "describe_ch": "自從聯合國在2015 年，率領世界領袖在「聯合國發展高峰會」發佈了《翻轉我們的世界：2030 年永續發展方針》並提出 17 項永續發展目標(Sustainable Development Goals, SDGs)之後，這份提及所有國家都面臨的問題之宣言已經成為世界各地、各行各業所依循的重大指標。學生應熟悉SDG的內容與精神，並在學習的過程中思索自行所學、專長能夠貢獻之處。此課程將帶領學生以現代科技、尊重環境永續發展的方式，與不同背景的同學相互合作、檢視並嘗試解決社會的問題，透過相互配合、協調、甚至相互競爭、制約，彼此激盪而取得成果。",
    "describe_eh": "World leaders set a goal of net-zero carbon emissions by 2050 at the 26th United Nations Climate Change Conference (COP26). Taiwan urgently needs talents who can perform carbon audits and assist companies in planning sustainable development strategies. This course will use actual industrial cases to lead students to follow international standard operating procedures to gradually investigate the industry's greenhouse gas emissions, analyze emission hotspots, discuss feasible solutions for carbon reduction, and carry out industrial sustainable path planning toward net-zero carbon emissions targets.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 4.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "1. 協助學生了解淨碳足跡盤查方法。\r\n2. 協助學生應用國際標準分析產業碳足跡排放與熱點。\r\n",
      "describe_en": "1. To lead students to explore the development of net-zero carbon emissions and carbon footprint calculation methods\r\n2. To help students to apply the internal standards to analyze the industrial carbon footprint emissions and hot-spot.\r\n"
    }
  ],
